WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:52.000
{\3c&H00C5D2&\fnArabic Typesetting\b1\4c&H000170&\c&H000000&\fs40}ترجمة
{\3c&HAA9600&\4c&H00003E&\c&H000000&\fnArabic Typesetting\fs35}||م.أحمد السيّد||
